    "result_text": "Typecheck passes clean. The change is complete and the acceptance test passes.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented **project labels (tags)** as a full-stack, additive change following the app's conventions.\n\n**Database** (`src/main/resources/db/migration/V13__project_tags.sql`)\n- New `tags` pool table and a `project_tags` many-to-many join table (`(project_id, tag_id)` as the primary key, so a label can't be added twice).\n\n**Server** (OfficeFloor REST on Spring Boot)\n- Entities/repos: `Tag`, `ProjectTag` (+ `ProjectTagId` composite key), `TagRepository`, `ProjectTagRepository`.\n- Logic classes + YAML wirings for four `/api/*` endpoints:\n  - `GET /api/tags` \u2014 the shared label pool (feeds the picker)\n  - `GET /api/projects/{projectId}/tags` \u2014 a project's chips\n  - `POST /api/projects/{projectId}/tags` \u2014 attach a label (404 unknown project/tag, 400 missing tagId)\n  - `POST /api/projects/{projectId}/tags/{tagId}/remove` \u2014 detach a label\n- Extended `/__test__` seed support: added `tags` + `project_tags` to the truncate list (child-before-parent) and seed handlers keyed by `tags` / `projectTags`, inserting with the fixture's explicit ids via `JdbcTemplate`.\n\n**Front-end** (new files only \u2014 nothing existing edited)\n- `features/tags/queries.ts` \u2014 `useQuery` keys `['tags']` and `['projects', id, 'tags']`, plus add/remove mutation fns.\n- `features/tags/ProjectTags.tsx` \u2014 chips (`project-tag-{id}`), per-chip remove (`project-tag-remove-{id}`), the picker `select` (`project-tag-add`) showing not-yet-assigned labels, and `project-tag-add-submit`. Reads its own data; mutations `invalidateQueries` the shared key; only the uncommitted picker choice uses `useState`.\n- `features/tags/tags.slot.tsx` \u2014 fills the existing `ProjectDetail` slot (rule 3), so the project detail page renders it without being touched.\n\nVerification: `bin/e2e` \u2192 **1 passed**; frontend `npm run typecheck` clean.",
